Spec: Windows public connection SDK

Purpose:
  Expose typed opt-in connection operations and process-pinned private data streams.

Owns:
  ./ConnectionApi.cs

References:
  ./VerifiedPipeClient.sdd
  /contracts/dotnet/LinkGate.Contracts/ConnectionOperation.sdd
  /contracts/dotnet/LinkGate.Contracts/ConnectionStatus.sdd

Must:
  Require negotiated connection.api and explicit experimental opt-in, caller-persisted mutation IDs and typed correlated results.
  Keep unknown mutation outcomes on the original operation UUID without automatic reconnect, redial or payload replay.
  Derive only the canonical local stream pipe name from streamRef and verify the same held Agent process before writing any attach header.
  Preserve duplex business stream semantics and release all owned pipe/process handles on failure.
